% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move move with *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as move.

the fluents are:
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *an index* isplayer *a second index* with *a role*; known as isplayer.
    *an index* is the leaf of *a second index*; known as leaf.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move move with *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_move.

the templates are:
    hasmove.
    the game is terminal.
    *a thing* is the opp of *a second thing*.
    the close of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    *a role* is a role.
    *a thing* is a hasmove.
    *a thing* is legal.

the knowledge base leafymcfallface includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/leafymcfallface.hrf".

red is the opp of blue.

blue is the opp of red.

the close of 1 is 2.

the close of 2 is 3.

the close of 3 is 4.

the close of 4 is 5.

the close of 5 is 6.

the close of 6 is 7.

the close of 2 is 1.

the close of 3 is 2.

the close of 4 is 3.

the close of 5 is 4.

the close of 6 is 5.

the close of 7 is 6.

the game is terminal if
    it is not the case that hasmove.

hasmove if
    a thing is legal.

the move move with an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    a role is a control at the time
    and a third index isplayer the second index with the role at the time
    and the close of the third index is the index
    and the index is the leaf of the second index at the time
    and the role is the opp of a thing
    and it is not the case that the index isplayer the second index with the thing at the time.

the move move with an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    a role is a control at the time
    and the index isplayer a third index with the role at the time
    and the close of the third index is the second index
    and the index is the leaf of the second index at the time
    and the role is the opp of a thing
    and it is not the case that the index isplayer the second index with the thing at the time.

the goal of red is 0 at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that hasmove.

the goal of red is 100 at a time if
    blue is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that hasmove.

the goal of a role is 50 at a time if
    the role is a role
    and red is a hasmove.

the goal of blue is 0 at a time if
    blue is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that hasmove.

the goal of blue is 100 at a time if
    red is a control at the time
    and it is not the case that hasmove.

when the move move with an index and a second index is made
    and a role is a control
    and a third index isplayer a fourth index with the role
then the index isplayer the second index with the role
    and it is not the case that the index is the leaf of the second index
    and it is not the case that the third index isplayer the fourth index with the role.

when the move move with an index and a second index is made
    and red is a control
then blue is a control
    and it is not the case that red is a control.

when the move move with an index and a second index is made
    and blue is a control
then red is a control
    and it is not the case that blue is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move move with an index and a second index is made
    and it is not the case that the move move with the index and the second index is legal.

initially 1 is the leaf of 2
    and 1 is the leaf of 3
    and 1 is the leaf of 4
    and 1 is the leaf of 5
    and 1 is the leaf of 6
    and 1 is the leaf of 7
    and 2 is the leaf of 1
    and 2 is the leaf of 2
    and 2 is the leaf of 3
    and 2 is the leaf of 4
    and 2 is the leaf of 5
    and 2 is the leaf of 6
    and 2 is the leaf of 7
    and 3 is the leaf of 1
    and 3 is the leaf of 2
    and 3 is the leaf of 3
    and 3 is the leaf of 4
    and 3 is the leaf of 5
    and 3 is the leaf of 6
    and 3 is the leaf of 7
    and 4 is the leaf of 1
    and 4 is the leaf of 2
    and 4 is the leaf of 3
    and 4 is the leaf of 4
    and 4 is the leaf of 5
    and 4 is the leaf of 6
    and 4 is the leaf of 7
    and 5 is the leaf of 1
    and 5 is the leaf of 2
    and 5 is the leaf of 3
    and 5 is the leaf of 4
    and 5 is the leaf of 5
    and 5 is the leaf of 6
    and 5 is the leaf of 7
    and 6 is the leaf of 1
